This behaviour is identical to that described in a previously raised issue, #1439. That issue was resolved by pre-creating all branches upfront, as the hash reference was found to be acting as a moving pointer between iterations. However, in this case, the same behaviour is observed even after explicitly setting an identical commit hash on each successive branch creation.

